2. **From Marcus Li (Director of Operations):** A proposal for cost-saving initiatives in Q2 is presented, including renegotiating vendor contracts, reducing energy consumption, and streamlining supply chain logistics. These initiatives are estimated to save the company up to $200,000 in the next quarter. Jordan is asked to review the proposal and discuss further."
